# Systems

This source documents "Systems" as a universal mental model for understanding and navigating complex situations. It provides a mental shortcut or framework for recognizing patterns and relationships in the world.

The model draws on 7 source perspectives:
- [[The Systems Bible - John Gall]]
- [[The Fifth Discipline - Peter M Senge]]
- [[The Fifth Discipline Fieldbook - Peter M Senge]]
- [[Thinking in Systems - Donella H Meadows]]
- [[Out of Control - Kevin Kelly]]
- [[Getting Things Done - David Allen]]
- [[The Alignment Problem - Brian Christian Tom Griffiths]]

Systems thinking is positioned as applicable across all domains, offering a cross-domain framework for sense-making.